# shortlist.md is the naming surface and it quotes clause text, so it is not
# committed. No document text is committed in this repository; the one
# committed place is inputs/labels/samples/. communities.csv and stoplist.csv
# carry ids and numbers and do commit.
analysis/discovery/shortlist.md

# Reduced vectors, cached on a checksum of the inputs and the settings so the
# scoring can be re-run without redoing UMAP. Re-derivable, and *.npy above
# already covers them; named here so the reason is written down.
analysis/discovery/reduced_*.npy

